 "style": {
  "sound_effects": "Sound effects and Gaia Memory/Driver voice lines in double quotes: \"SLASH!!!\", \"INVISIBLE\".",
  "roars": "Keep kaiju/creature roars consistent: check earlier slices' English for the same Japanese roar before inventing one. Established: Bemstar \"Kwaaah-kiiiiiii!!\"; Antlar \"Kiiaaaah~~~!!\"; Bat Man \"Kikikikiki!!\"; Mantis Man \"Gyeeeeeh!!\"; T-Rex Dopant \"Gwaaaargh!!\". Gomora \"Gyaaaaaaaaah!!\" / \"Gwaaaaaaaaah!!\". Shocker kaijin cry \"Igiiiiiiih!!\"; Gomora growl \"Grrruuu...\". Red King \"Kiiigwaaaah!!!\". Shiomaneking \"Abiiih!! Abi-abi!!\". Mururoa \"Gyaaaooooooh!!\". Pandon \"Kiiiiiih!!\" / \"Kih!?\". Mr. Bushido kirisute gomen: \"Cut you dooown!!! Pardon meeeee!!!\". Bogal \"Kweeeeeeeh!!\". King Pandon \"Kih!! Kih!! Kiiiiiiih!!\"; Snowgon \"Gwaaa-gwooo~~~!!\". Tyrant \"Gyiaaaaaaaaah!!\"; Bogal Monst \"Gwaaaaaaaaaaaaaaargh!!!!\". Birdon \"Kiiiiiiiiiih!!\" / \"Kih!! Kih!! Kiiii...ih!!!\". Gundam Head \"Gyurururururu...!!!\". Geronimon \"Grrrr...\". Vakishim \"Fuhaaaah!!\". Alien Metron \"Gwaaaaaagh!!\". Eleking \"Kiiiiiiiiiiih!!\". Seagorath \"Groooooooh!!\"; Seamons \"Kiiiiigwah!!\".",
  "catchphrases": "Zero: 'You're 20,000 years too early!'; Kintaros: 'You'll cry!'; Ryutaros: 'I don't care about your answer!'; Momotaros: 'Here I come!'; W: 'Now, count up your sins!'; God Gundam: 'My hand is burnin' red!'; Arche Gundam (Ali): 'Not so fast!!' (tokoro ga gicchon)",
  "honorifics": "Drop -san/-chan/-kun; carry politeness through tone. Exceptions: 'Sempai' (Imagin->Momotaros), 'Master X' for the Maganac addressing their leader. Villain -sama to a superior -> \"Lord X\" (Lord Weather, Lord Ikadevil, Lord Terror Dopant). Ultras to elder brothers -> \"Brother X\".",
  "den_o_belt": "Den-O belt calls in caps and quotes: \"SWORD FORM\", \"ROD FORM\", \"AX FORM\", \"GUN FORM\".",
  "fixed_lines": "Momotaros: 'I'm at my climax right from the start!!'; Urataros: 'How about you let me reel you in?'; Kintaros: 'My strength made ya cry. Wipe yer tears with this.'; Lockon: 'Aiming and firing!'",
  "party_order": "Leader-variant blocks follow the Pt_Chara_Check order in the event script; voice each variant accordingly.",
  "venues": "Regis Fight match cards: \"Opponent: X\nVenue: Floor 2 Center, City District B\" (Floor N + area, City District X).",
  "prompts": "Cage/sign prompts: \"Read the sign?\" / \"Unlock the cage?\"",
  "pigmon": "Pigmon ends sentences with \"ppi\": write it as a \"-pi\" suffix (\"Thank you for saving me-pi!\"), like Jashrine's \"-jaja\". Speech through the Pan-Space Interpreter (katakana/kanji in the source) is ALL CAPS with no contractions: \"YOU ALL. WHAT HAPPENED WITH ALIEN BALTAN?\""
 },
